Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] raspi: implement GetVideoSystem

Provide the video-system query declared by the common HAL interface. The
Raspberry Pi backend currently uses the existing 720p50 default mode.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 raspi/video.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/raspi/video.cpp b/raspi/video.cpp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/raspi/video.cpp
+++ b/raspi/video.cpp
@@ -83,0 +84,5 @@
+int cVideo::GetVideoSystem(void)
+{
+	return VIDEO_STD_720P50;
+}
+
